Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 15:13:46 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] arm: mvebu: add Yamaha RTX830 inherited-DDR chainloading

DDR and board initialization are supplied by the vendor loader.
Only the SD autoboot variant is included.

Signed-off-by: Kosuke Shibuya <kakiringopcneko@gmail.com>
